	Section:
		Text: Figures
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Number format and unnumbered figures
		Paragraph: `Number format` writes the number in letters or Roman numerals and `Number label` sets what goes around it, with `{number}` where it goes. `Numbered: false` leaves a figure without a number, and the next one continues the count.
